<title>USA: PictureTel, Philips video conference pact.</title>
<headline>PictureTel, Philips video conference pact.</headline>
<dateline>ANDOVER, Mass. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PictureTel Corp said Tuesday that it and Philips Business Electronics, a division of Philips Electronics NV, have agreed to market PictureTel's compact videoconferencing system under the Philips banner.</p>
<p>The maker and marketer of videoconferencing systems said it and Philips will explore joint product development and integrate Philips' technologies into future PictureTel products under the agreement.</p>
<p>PictureTel was trading at 34-3/8 Tuesday noon, down 2-13/16 from the close.</p>
